 ## Build
 
+### macOS (Apple Silicon)
+
+Requires macOS 13 or newer, Xcode Command Line Tools, and a current Rust toolchain.
+Run `scripts/Build-MacOS.sh` on an M-series Mac. The game uses Metal through wgpu
+and SDL3 for controller input. The script creates
+`target/skate3rust-macos-arm64/Skate3Rust.app`.
+
+The Windows first-run setup/updater helpers are not used on macOS. Until a native
+setup helper is packaged, launch the executable from Terminal with a prepared asset
+directory using `--assets /path/to/assets` or set `SKATE3_ASSETS`. Skate 3 assets
+are not included.
+
+### Windows
+
 Requires Windows, Rust with the MSVC toolchain, and LLVM installed in its default
 location. Run `BUILD.bat` to build, then `PLAY.bat` to launch the test world.
 `PLAY.bat` opens your saved map (University by default); use the in-game menu to switch maps, or drag a `.skate` file onto `PLAY.bat`. An SDL3-compatible gamepad is required for gameplay;
